# Local soundness of CMP (i32/i64 eqz, eq, ne, lt/gt/le/ge _s/_u)

Generated by `gen/gen_cmp.py`.  The comparison is a borrow chain on `X' - Y'` where
`(X, Y) = (a, b)` or `(b, a)` (gt, le) and `X' = X + 2^(w-1)` mod `2^w` for signed comparisons
(msb flip); equality is "all difference limbs zero" with an inverse witness.
-/
namespace WasmBase.Local
